{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1503211-storypath-discord-dicebot-trinity-continuum-dice","id":1503211,"title":"Storypath Discord Dicebot - Trinity Continuum Dice","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-02-16T00:49:43-08:00","id":1503211,"title":"Storypath Discord Dicebot - Trinity Continuum Dice","content":"I was slightly frustrated with most dicebot getting close but usually falling short with Dice Pool systems. I reached out to Mirai-Miki on the Realms of Darkness Discord server if he could create Storypath Dicebot as it would be similiar to some he has already made. He is very talented as you will see.<br /> <br /> <br /> <u><b>Supports</b></u><ul><li>Dice Pool</li> <li>Enhancement (with 1+ successes)</li> <li>Difficulty (1 default)</li> <li>Target Number (for higher tiers, 8 default)</li> <li>Crit Target (for lower rerolls, 10 default)</li> <li>Double Crits (not needed for official Storypath)</li> <li>Character Name</li> <li>Notes</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <u><b>Results</b></u><br /> (based on successes and difficulty)<ul><li>Botch (no success and 1s)</li> <li>Fail (below difficulty)</li> <li>Success (match difficulty)</li> <li>Successes with Stunts (exceeds difficulty)</li> </ul><br /> <br /> <u><b>Update Shortlist</b></u><ul><li>Renaming Crit Target to simple Rerolls</li> <li>Replacing the 1 die result icon with ? Maybe just the number</li> <li>Replacing the 10 die result icon with ? Maybe just the number</li> </ul><br /> <br /> Feel free to comments for me with any suggestions or changes for the dicebot to make it more Storypath.<br /> <br /> The link to the bot is <a href=\"https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=1026717393004806154&amp;scope=bot%20applications.commands&amp;permissions=0\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> The most common question ...<br /> <br /> <b>Emojis not showing up in my bot reply</b><b